                                "sense_id": "42219670-3bdb-3258-adbb-ddc37873af9d",
                                "text": "He much prefers it pemmicanized.\" A few years later, another presciently observed, \"What one may call the era of the Pemmicanisation of life is rapidly approaching.\""
